<title>POLAND: FORECAST-Polish zloty seen at 3.3672 vs dlr end-97. [CORRECTED 15:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Polish zloty seen at 3.3672 vs dlr end-97. [CORRECTED 15:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish zloty is seen easing against the dollar by the end of the year but the prediction is less pessimistic than last month, according to a Reuter poll of the country's 26 largest banks.</p>
<p>On Monday the zloty was fixed at 3.1420 to the dollar.</p>
<p>		    MAY	   END-97	   12-MONTHS AHEAD</p>
<p> USD/PLN AVG   3.1624    3.3672 (3.3817)   3.4718 (3.4951)</p>
<p>     MINIMUM   3.1300    3.1900 (3.1800)   3.2120 (3.2200)</p>
<p>     MAXIMUM   3.2000    3.5200 (3.7000)   3.7500 (4.1500) (Corrects</p>
<p>								 figure from 3.5200)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets previous figures for end-97 and April-98 from last month's poll.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
